# Eval battery run outputs -- working scratch from local harness
# validation runs, not meant to be committed by default. Doesn't affect
# already-tracked historical snapshots (e.g. battery-results/2026-08-19-*),
# only keeps new run output out of `git status` -- `git add -f` still works
# for a snapshot deliberately kept as a historical record.
pi/evals/battery-results/
